  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed ground floor side extension, due to its height and design, would give\r\nrise to an unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition to the existing\r\ndwellinghouse, unbalancing the visual symmetry with the adjoining dwelling to\r\nthe detriment of the character and appearance of the immediate area, contrary\r\nto the high quality design aspiration of the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2026), Policy D3 (D.1 and D.11) of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the\r\nHarrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow\r\nSupplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
